WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.628
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.712 --> 00:05.004
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.088 --> 00:06.506
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.341
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.425 --> 00:11.094
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.177 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.598
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.682 --> 00:17.517
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.600 --> 00:19.227
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.310 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.314
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.398 --> 00:25.483
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.567 --> 00:26.609
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.693 --> 00:27.777
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.861 --> 00:29.487
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.571 --> 00:31.614
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.698 --> 00:33.491
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.575 --> 00:37.203
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:58.308 --> 01:00.351
: Help!
： 帮助！

01:00.435 --> 01:02.937
Hey, yah!
嘿，呀！

01:03.021 --> 01:04.355
Help, help.
救命，救命。

01:04.439 --> 01:05.732
Whoa, stop.
哇，停下来。

01:05.815 --> 01:08.610
There, there,
you're safe now, little lady.
那里，那里，
你现在安全了，小女士。

01:11.070 --> 01:12.238
You fool.
你这个傻瓜。

01:12.322 --> 01:13.907
You've fallen into my trap.
你已经掉进我的陷阱里了。

01:13.990 --> 01:17.243
Now you're mine,
SpongeBob the strong.
现在你是我的了
海绵宝宝强者。

01:17.327 --> 01:20.371
So we meet again, crazyfish.
所以我们又见面了，疯狂的鱼。

01:20.455 --> 01:22.207
Bring it on.
来吧。

01:22.290 --> 01:23.416
With pleasure.
荣幸。

01:24.459 --> 01:26.377
: So loud.
: 这么大声。

01:26.461 --> 01:29.005
You ready to get crazy,
huh, crazyfish?
你准备好疯狂了
哈，疯鱼？

01:29.088 --> 01:31.549
You bet your frosting,
sponge-cake.
你打赌你的糖霜，
海绵蛋糕。

01:31.633 --> 01:34.093
Sorry, I'm not wearing
any frosting.
抱歉，我没穿
任何糖霜。

01:38.348 --> 01:39.974
Hey, that's cheating.
嘿，那是作弊。

01:40.058 --> 01:40.934
No, it's not.
不，不是。

01:41.017 --> 01:42.143
Yes, it is.
是的。

01:42.227 --> 01:43.353
Is not.
不是。

01:43.436 --> 01:44.687
Is not, is not...
不是、不是……

01:46.189 --> 01:47.273
Um, guys?
嗯，伙计们？

01:47.357 --> 01:49.234
Anyway, your shoe's untied.
不管怎样，你的鞋带已经解开了。

01:49.317 --> 01:50.276
Is not!
不是！

01:50.360 --> 01:51.778
Guys.
伙计们。

01:51.861 --> 01:53.154
Is too, is too...
太、太……

01:53.238 --> 01:54.447
The train!
火车！

01:54.531 --> 01:57.367
Don't worry, I'm ready.
别担心，我已经准备好了。

01:57.450 --> 01:58.576
Bring it on.
来吧。

02:02.121 --> 02:03.957
Oh, good morning Gare-bear.
哦，早上好，小熊车站。

02:04.040 --> 02:05.458
Meow.
喵。

02:05.542 --> 02:08.461
I kept you up all night
with my nocturnal outbursts?
我让你彻夜难眠
我的夜间爆发？

02:08.545 --> 02:09.754
Again?
再次？

02:09.838 --> 02:10.922
Meow?
喵？

02:11.005 --> 02:12.257
No, no, Tuesday night
was the one
不不不，周二晚上
就是那个

02:12.340 --> 02:13.508
with the 30-foot librarian.
与30英尺高的图书管理员。

02:13.591 --> 02:15.385
Last night was the one
where I defeat
昨晚就是那个
我打败的地方

02:15.468 --> 02:18.429
notorious arch-villain
Jack M. Crazyfish
臭名昭著的大恶棍
杰克·M·疯狂鱼

02:18.513 --> 02:20.390
using the sheer force
使用纯粹的力量

02:20.473 --> 02:22.934
of my awesomely
developed musculature.
我的真棒
发达的肌肉组织。

03:03.558 --> 03:04.934
Whew, what a relief.
哇，真是松了一口气。

03:05.018 --> 03:07.103
For a second there I thought
I gave myself a black...
有那么一瞬间我想
我给了自己一个黑...

03:07.186 --> 03:08.938
Whoa... Oh.
哇...哦。

03:09.022 --> 03:10.773
Eye.
眼睛。

03:25.455 --> 03:27.373
Meow.
喵。

03:27.457 --> 03:28.708
Go away, Gary.
走开，加里。

03:28.791 --> 03:30.793
I'm busy... Wallowing.
我很忙... 打滚。

03:30.877 --> 03:31.961
Meow?
喵？

03:32.045 --> 03:33.379
I did something
so dumb to myself
我做了一些事
对自己来说太愚蠢了

03:33.463 --> 03:35.548
that even you would laugh
uncontrollably at me.
连你都会笑
无法控制地对着我。

03:35.632 --> 03:37.133
: Meow.
: 喵。

03:37.216 --> 03:39.010
You promise you won't laugh?
你保证不笑？

03:39.093 --> 03:40.678
OK, here goes.
好的，开始了。

03:40.762 --> 03:42.388
Gary, I gave myself
a black eye
加里，我给了自己
一只黑眼圈

03:42.472 --> 03:43.681
trying to open
the toothpaste.
试图打开
牙膏。

03:45.725 --> 03:47.393
Thanks for not laughing, Gare.
谢谢你没有笑，Gare。

03:47.477 --> 03:48.478
I knew you'd...
我就知道你会...

03:48.561 --> 03:50.563
Gare?
车站？

03:58.696 --> 04:00.031
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

04:00.114 --> 04:01.741
Hey, cool glasses.
嘿，很酷的眼镜。

04:01.824 --> 04:03.660
Can I try them on... Oh!
我可以试穿一下吗...哦！

04:03.743 --> 04:05.411
SpongeBob, your eye.
海绵宝宝，你的眼睛。

04:05.495 --> 04:07.246
It's all black and swollen.
浑身又黑又肿。

04:07.330 --> 04:09.582
How'd you mess
your eye up, SpongeBob?
你怎么搞砸了
海绵宝宝，你的眼睛抬起来了吗？

04:09.666 --> 04:11.292
Did somebody hit you?
有人打你吗？

04:11.376 --> 04:12.502
Where is he?
他在哪儿？

04:12.585 --> 04:14.504
Yeah, we'll settle
this like men.
是的，我们会解决的
这就像男人一样。

04:14.587 --> 04:15.421
We'll sue him.
我们会起诉他。

04:15.505 --> 04:16.923
No, no, it's OK, Patrick.
不，不，没关系，帕特里克。

04:17.006 --> 04:18.508
He, uh...
他，呃…

04:18.591 --> 04:21.177
He learned his lesson.
他吸取了教训。

04:21.260 --> 04:23.304
Are you sure, SpongeBob?
你确定吗，海绵宝宝？

04:23.388 --> 04:24.430
Who was this guy anyway?
这家伙到底是谁？

04:24.514 --> 04:26.516
Hmm...
唔...

04:26.599 --> 04:28.810
It was Jack M. Crazyfish.
这是杰克·M·疯狂鱼。

04:28.893 --> 04:31.270
You've never seen anyone
like this guy, Patrick.
你从未见过任何人
就像帕特里克这个人。

04:31.354 --> 04:32.647
He was about 60 feet tall.
他大约有 60 英尺高。

04:32.730 --> 04:33.606
: Oh.
： 哦。

04:33.690 --> 04:36.192
Yeah, he was big and mean.
是的，他又大又刻薄。

04:36.275 --> 04:37.527
Oh, but ol' SpongeBob here
哦，但是海绵宝宝在这里

04:37.610 --> 04:40.279
knows how to teach
a lummox some manners.
知道如何教学
一些礼仪上的笨拙。

04:40.363 --> 04:41.531
What did you do?
你做了什么？

04:41.614 --> 04:43.116
I handled him
the same way I handle
我对付他
和我处理的方式一样

04:43.199 --> 04:45.576
all enormous
muscle-bound villains.
都巨大的
肌肉发达的恶棍。

04:45.660 --> 04:46.452
With tears?
带着泪水？

04:46.536 --> 04:48.121
Uh, no, with a little
呃，不，有一点

04:48.204 --> 04:49.288
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

04:49.372 --> 04:50.415
And a ka-zow!
还有一声卡佐！

04:50.498 --> 04:52.625
And a gallon of
hi-yah, hi-yah, ha!
还有一加仑
嗨呀，嗨呀，哈！

04:52.709 --> 04:54.460
Yeah, he never
knew what hit 'em.
是的，他从来没有
知道是什么击中了他们。

04:54.544 --> 04:55.628
Well, then what happened?
嗯，然后发生了什么？

04:55.712 --> 04:57.755
I woke up...
Oh, I mean, I...
我醒了...
哦，我是说，我...

04:57.839 --> 05:00.091
I know exactly what you mean.
我完全明白你的意思。

05:00.174 --> 05:02.593
You whooped him
with your eyes closed.
你对他大喊大叫
闭上眼睛。

05:02.677 --> 05:05.471
That is exactly
what I mean, Patrick.
那正是
我的意思是，帕特里克。

05:05.555 --> 05:06.848
Well, see you later, buddy.
好吧，待会儿见，伙计。

05:06.931 --> 05:09.642
There goes a real hero.
真正的英雄走了。

05:09.726 --> 05:11.644
Wha, wah-bah-bah!
哇、哇、哇、哇！

05:11.728 --> 05:14.439
Slugger,
that's me.
重击手，
那是我。

05:14.522 --> 05:15.481
What the?
什么？

05:17.817 --> 05:20.153
Yee haw.
哎哟。

05:20.236 --> 05:21.821
Get along little fishies.
和小鱼儿相处吧。

05:23.197 --> 05:24.323
Hi, Sandy.
嗨，桑迪。

05:24.407 --> 05:26.242
Whoa.
哇哦。

05:26.325 --> 05:27.910
Hot catsnake in a barn.
谷仓里的热猫蛇。

05:28.703 --> 05:30.079
Look at your eye.
看看你的眼睛。

05:30.163 --> 05:31.289
Land sakes.
土地缘故。

05:31.372 --> 05:33.332
That's quite a shiner
you got there.
这是相当耀眼的
你到了那里。

05:33.416 --> 05:35.001
Well, don't you worry none.
好吧，你不用担心。

05:35.084 --> 05:36.669
I know some natural
remedies that'll...
我知道一些自然的
补救措施将...

05:36.753 --> 05:38.671
Keep your natural
remedies to yourself.
保持你的自然
对自己的补救措施。

05:38.755 --> 05:41.257
Manly dudes like
me don't need 'em.
有男子气概的男人喜欢
我不需要它们。

05:41.340 --> 05:42.467
I'll have you know
我会让你知道

05:42.550 --> 05:45.053
I got this black eye in a fight.
我在一场战斗中被打肿了。

05:45.136 --> 05:46.054
A fight?
打架？

05:46.137 --> 05:48.014
Well, there's no
shame in losing.
嗯，没有
因失败而感到耻辱。

05:48.097 --> 05:49.265
Lose?
失去？

05:49.348 --> 05:51.517
Sandy, I taught the fish
who tangled with me
桑迪，我教了鱼
谁与我纠缠

05:51.601 --> 05:53.394
a lesson he shan't soon forget.
他不会很快忘记这一教训。

05:53.478 --> 05:54.520
Why?
为什么？

05:54.604 --> 05:55.688
Did he write it down?
他写下来了吗？

05:55.772 --> 05:58.441
No, I engraved it
on his pain gland.
不，是我刻的
在他的疼痛腺上。

05:58.524 --> 06:02.528
Well, what type of man scuffles
boots with you and loses?
那么，什么样的男人会扭打呢？
和你一起靴子然后输了？

06:02.612 --> 06:04.530
Oh, this was no mere man.
哦，这不仅仅是一个男人。

06:04.614 --> 06:06.699
He was the notorious outlaw
他是臭名昭著的歹徒

06:06.783 --> 06:08.618
Jack M. Crazyfish!
杰克·M·疯狂鱼！

06:08.701 --> 06:10.703
Jack M. Crazyfish?
杰克·M·疯狂鱼？

06:10.787 --> 06:12.663
It all happened
late last night...
这一切都发生了
昨晚很晚...

06:12.747 --> 06:15.458
...I was walking home
from work... alone
……我正走回家
下班...独自一人

06:15.541 --> 06:18.628
when all of a sudden, crazyfish
sprang up out of nowhere.
突然之间，疯狂的鱼
凭空出现。

06:18.711 --> 06:20.088
He threw a giant tire
他扔了一个巨大的轮胎

06:20.171 --> 06:21.547
at the back of my head.
在我的脑后。

06:21.631 --> 06:23.716
Then, he stood over me to gloat.
然后，他站在我身边幸灾乐祸。

06:23.800 --> 06:27.220
I jumped up and karate
kicked his hairpiece
right off of its snaps.
我跳起来空手道
踢了他的假发
就在它的快照上。

06:27.303 --> 06:30.389
He was so ashamed
he ran all the way home
他很羞愧
他一路跑回家

06:30.473 --> 06:32.350
leaving behind a pool of tears.
留下一滩泪水。

06:32.433 --> 06:35.853
Which I then proceeded to scoop
up in my victory tankard
然后我开始挖掘
在我的胜利酒杯中

06:35.937 --> 06:39.107
and enjoy as a nice
refreshing beverage.
并享受作为一个美好的
提神饮料。

06:39.190 --> 06:41.567
So how'd you get
the black eye then?
那你是怎么得到的
那么黑眼圈呢？

06:41.651 --> 06:43.069
Oh, yeah, well, that's right.
哦，是的，嗯，没错。

06:43.152 --> 06:45.696
I had miscalculated the
trajectory of my cup
我错误地计算了
我的杯子的轨迹

06:45.780 --> 06:47.740
and the straw
jabbed me in the eye
和稻草
戳我的眼睛

06:47.824 --> 06:49.575
giving me this awful shiner.
给我这个可怕的光泽。

06:51.160 --> 06:52.578
Well, looks like you're late
for your day job, killer.
嗯，看来你来晚了
为了你的日常工作，杀手。

06:52.662 --> 06:54.122
Aw, phooey.
噢，呸。

06:54.205 --> 06:55.706
Late schmate.
迟到的施密特。

06:55.790 --> 06:59.418
A tough guy like me can show up
to work whenever he wants.
像我这样的硬汉也能出现
他想什么时候工作就什么时候工作。

06:59.502 --> 07:01.003
Adios.
再见。

07:03.548 --> 07:07.093
SpongeBob is 13-1/2 minutes
late for duty.
海绵宝宝时长 13-1/2 分钟
上班迟到了。

07:07.176 --> 07:10.930
I hope for his sake this means
he was in a horrible accident.
我希望为了他，这意味着
他遭遇了一场可怕的事故。

07:14.934 --> 07:17.436
Well, looks like I was right
about the accident part.
嗯，看来我是对的
关于事故部分。

07:20.815 --> 07:21.983
Oh.
哦。

07:22.066 --> 07:23.943
Yeah, that's right, pal,
do the right thing.
是的，没错，朋友，
做正确的事。

07:24.026 --> 07:26.445
Just keep on walking.
继续走吧。

07:28.698 --> 07:30.116
Ugh, do you mind?
呃，你介意吗？

07:30.199 --> 07:32.285
We're trying to have
a decent meal here.
我们正在努力拥有
在这里吃一顿像样的饭。

07:32.368 --> 07:35.037
That's right.
这是正确的。

07:42.461 --> 07:44.046
SpongeBob, I'm...
海绵宝宝，我...

07:44.130 --> 07:46.799
Dah-dah-dah-dah,
I'm just gonna stop you
right there, Squidward.
哒哒哒哒哒，
我只是要阻止你
就在那里，章鱼哥。

07:46.883 --> 07:48.217
Spare you the oxygen.
省点氧气吧

07:48.301 --> 07:51.387
We all know you weaker folk
can't afford to waste it.
我们都知道你们这些弱者
不能浪费它。

07:51.470 --> 07:53.389
All right folks, listen up.
好吧，各位，听着。

07:53.472 --> 07:55.183
'Cause I'm only gonna
say this once.
因为我只会
说这一次。

07:55.266 --> 07:58.519
SpongeBob: Tough guys don't
like to repeat themselves.
海绵宝宝：硬汉不会
喜欢重复自己。

07:58.603 --> 08:00.980
I'm talking to you, grandma!
我在跟你说话呢，奶奶！

08:01.898 --> 08:04.483
Now I suppose all of
you are wondering
现在我想所有的
你想知道

08:04.567 --> 08:06.027
how I got this black eye.
我怎么得了这个黑眼圈。

08:06.110 --> 08:07.320
Squidward: Not really.
章鱼哥：不完全是。

08:07.403 --> 08:08.654
All right, who said that?
好吧，谁说的？

08:08.738 --> 08:09.822
Was it you, grandma?
是你吗，奶奶？

08:11.157 --> 08:12.742
It was me,
I said it.
是我，
我说过了。

08:15.578 --> 08:18.581
Well, folks, I don't happen
to see it as a shiner
好吧，伙计们，我不会发生这样的事
将其视为闪亮者

08:18.664 --> 08:22.668
so much as a shining trophy
of my glorious triumph
so much as a shining trophy
我光荣的胜利

08:22.752 --> 08:23.836
over the forces of evil.
战胜邪恶势力。

08:23.920 --> 08:25.546
Oh, I know what
you're thinking.
哦，我知道什么
你在想。

08:25.630 --> 08:28.883
Who in the name of Neptune
would want to tangle
谁以海王星的名义
会想要纠结

08:28.966 --> 08:31.969
with a guy like
SpongeBob SquarePants?
和一个像这样的人
海绵宝宝？

08:32.053 --> 08:33.554
Well, I'll tell you who?
好吧，我告诉你是谁？

08:34.555 --> 08:36.515
It was a peaceful morning
in Bikini Bottom.
这是一个宁静的早晨
在比基尼底部。

08:36.599 --> 08:40.353
I emerged from
my fruit-shaped bungalow
fresh as a bee
我从
我的水果形平房
像蜜蜂一样新鲜

08:40.436 --> 08:42.647
When a wanton cry of distress
当肆意的哀嚎时

08:42.730 --> 08:44.190
pounded against my eardrum.
敲击着我的耳膜。

08:44.273 --> 08:45.107
Hold it.
握住它。

08:45.191 --> 08:46.317
Sponges don't have eardrums.
海绵没有耳膜。

08:46.400 --> 08:47.652
He's right.
他是对的。

08:47.735 --> 08:50.404
Hey, let's save all the
questions until the end.
嘿，让我们拯救所有
问题直到最后。

08:50.488 --> 08:51.614
As I was saying...
正如我所说...

08:51.697 --> 08:53.574
I quickly located
the source of the cry
我很快找到了
哭泣的源头

08:53.658 --> 08:56.410
which was a victim
tied at my feet.
这是受害者
绑在我脚边。

08:56.494 --> 08:58.371
Don't worry,
I'll save you.
别担心，
我会救你的。

08:58.454 --> 08:59.705
...I assured...
...我保证...

08:59.789 --> 09:02.458
when a large bowling pin
struck me in the face.
当一个大保龄球瓶时
打在我脸上。

09:02.541 --> 09:06.128
The hurler was none other
than Jack M. Crazyfish.
投掷者不是别人
比杰克·M·疯狂鱼。

09:06.212 --> 09:08.881
And I could tell by that
cold sore on his lip
我可以看出
他嘴唇上有唇疱疹

09:08.965 --> 09:11.592
that today he meant business.
今天他是认真的。

09:11.676 --> 09:12.802
With cat-like reflexes
拥有猫般的反应能力

09:12.885 --> 09:14.553
I preempted his attack.
我先发制人了他的攻击。

09:14.637 --> 09:16.138
But the scoundrel
had me sabotaged
但恶棍
让我破坏了

09:16.222 --> 09:19.850
and I fell face down on
a pile of extra large staples.
我脸朝下倒在
一堆超大的订书钉。

09:19.934 --> 09:21.435
He lunged at me.
他向我扑来。

09:21.519 --> 09:23.562
But I got him in the ribs with
my novelty feather duster.
但我让他的肋骨
我的新奇鸡毛掸子。

09:23.646 --> 09:27.733
Down he fell like a mighty oak.
他像一棵巨大的橡树一样倒下了。

09:27.817 --> 09:28.943
And there he lay.
他就躺在那里。

09:29.026 --> 09:30.820
The very thought
of being vanquished
正是这个想法
被征服的

09:30.903 --> 09:33.864
made Jack M. Crazyfish
burst into tears.
杰克·M·疯狂鱼
泪流满面。

09:33.948 --> 09:36.158
The force of his crying
was so strong
他哭泣的力量
太强了

09:36.242 --> 09:38.744
I had to take evasive action.
我不得不采取回避行动。

09:38.828 --> 09:40.705
But one of the blasts
went haywire
但其中一场爆炸
失控了

09:40.788 --> 09:41.914
and hit me right in the face.
并打在我脸上。

09:41.998 --> 09:44.250
And that's how I got
this black eye
这就是我得到的
这个黑眼圈

09:44.333 --> 09:46.127
by giving Jack M. Crazyfish
通过给予 Jack M. Crazyfish

09:46.210 --> 09:47.753
the whompin' of a lifetime.
一生难忘的人。

09:47.837 --> 09:50.089
Whoo... Football!
哇...足球！

09:51.257 --> 09:53.175
Uh, what did you say
he looked like again?
呃，你说什么
他又看起来像什么了？

09:53.259 --> 09:55.636
Oh, kind of tall,
handlebar moustache...
哦，有点高，
车把小胡子...

09:55.720 --> 09:56.679
Little Green hat?
小绿帽子？

09:56.762 --> 09:57.930
I kind of thought it was teal
我还以为是青色

09:58.014 --> 09:59.015
but that sounds like
him all right.
但这听起来像
他没事。

09:59.098 --> 10:00.558
Wait a second.
等一下。

10:00.641 --> 10:02.601
How did you know he was
wearing a green hat  ?
你怎么知道他是
戴着绿帽子？

10:05.938 --> 10:09.191
He's... real.
他是……真实的。

10:09.275 --> 10:12.028
I'm looking
for SpongeBob Square...
我在找
对于海绵宝宝广场...

10:12.111 --> 10:14.739
Mr. Crazyfish, please
don't skin me alive.
疯狂鱼先生，请
别活剥我的皮。

10:14.822 --> 10:16.157
I made all that stuff up.
这些都是我编出来的。

10:16.240 --> 10:18.784
I was just kidding about
whomping you, right folks?
我只是开玩笑
打你，对吧伙计们？

10:18.868 --> 10:19.910
You remember.
你记得。

10:19.994 --> 10:21.620
I liked the part
where you told us
我喜欢这个部分
你告诉我们的地方

10:21.704 --> 10:24.206
how he was crying like a baby.
他哭得像个婴儿。

10:28.836 --> 10:29.962
... Hi, Gary.
……嗨，加里。

10:32.048 --> 10:33.424
All right, look.
好吧，看吧。

10:33.507 --> 10:36.093
I had a toothpaste tube,
like this.
我有一个牙膏管，
像这样。

10:36.177 --> 10:38.429
But I couldn't get it open
'cause the cap was stuck.
但我无法打开它
因为盖子被卡住了。

10:38.512 --> 10:39.805
And I guess...
我猜...

10:39.889 --> 10:41.682
I haven't been working my
arms out that much lately.
我还没有工作过
最近手臂这么大。

10:41.766 --> 10:44.226
So I opened it up-
like this.
于是我打开了它——
像这样。

10:44.310 --> 10:46.103
Then I was walkin', like this.
然后我就这样走着。

10:46.187 --> 10:48.064
And I didn't see where
the cap went, like this.
而且我没看到哪里
帽子就这样走了。

10:48.147 --> 10:49.357
I slipped on it
我在上面滑倒了

10:49.440 --> 10:50.941
and I landed right on my wrench,
like this.
我正好落在我的扳手上，
像这样。

10:52.360 --> 10:55.821
And I gave myself a black eye,
like this.
我还给自己打了个黑眼圈
像这样。

10:55.905 --> 10:56.989
Uh, like these.
呃，就像这些。

10:57.073 --> 10:58.532
So you see?
所以你看到了吗？

10:58.616 --> 11:01.911
I made it all up so I could
keep from looking stupid.
我编造了这一切，这样我就可以
不要显得愚蠢。

11:01.994 --> 11:03.662
Makes sense, doesn't it?
有道理，不是吗？

11:03.746 --> 11:05.247
Uh, not really.
呃，不是真的。

11:05.331 --> 11:09.251
I'm here because I heard you
make a really good Krabby Patty.
我来这里是因为我听到了你的声音
做一个非常好的蟹肉饼。

11:10.753 --> 11:14.673
One super hot and delicious
custom order Krabby Patty
with extra sauce, milord.
一份超级热又好吃
定制订单 蟹肉饼
加额外的酱汁，大人。

11:14.757 --> 11:17.510
Served directly to your
waiting... Ow!
直接送达您的
等待着……哎哟！

11:18.803 --> 11:21.847
Head and neck area.
头部和颈部区域。

11:21.931 --> 11:24.016
Sir, please, I am so sorry.
先生，求求你了，我很抱歉。

11:24.100 --> 11:27.019
Where I'm from,
sorry don't cut it.
我来自哪里，
抱歉，别剪了。

11:27.103 --> 11:30.606
We settle things
in a different kind of way.
我们解决事情
以一种不同的方式。

11:36.112 --> 11:39.240
SpongeBob: No!
海绵宝宝：不！

11:50.459 --> 11:52.336
Man: Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy
男：人鱼男
和藤壶男孩

11:52.420 --> 11:55.214
have been captured
by the evil Man Ray.
已被捕获
由邪恶的曼·雷所为。

11:56.715 --> 11:58.884
...tickled to the point
of wetting themselves
……痒到了极点
弄湿自己

11:58.968 --> 12:02.054
and sent on
a conveyor belt of doom
并发送到
厄运的传送带

12:02.638 --> 12:04.557
to their watery grave.
到他们的水坟墓。

12:04.640 --> 12:07.059
We cannot escape,
Barnacle Boy.
我们无法逃避，
藤壶男孩。

12:07.143 --> 12:08.561
He's too strong.
他太强了。

12:08.644 --> 12:10.229
Like the unbeatable taste
喜欢无与伦比的味道

12:10.312 --> 12:12.148
of a Krusty Kids Meal.
Krusty 儿童餐。

12:13.649 --> 12:16.819
The delicious new treat
no mortal can resist?
美味的新款待
没有凡人能够抗拒？

12:16.902 --> 12:18.070
Yup.
是的。

12:18.154 --> 12:20.906
Ooh, I just love the
little Pip-Squeak Patty
哦，我只是喜欢
小匹普-吱吱帕蒂

12:20.990 --> 12:23.701
small fries
and cold juice product.
小薯条
和冷果汁产品。

12:23.784 --> 12:25.911
Man: Of course you do,
Man Ray.
男：你当然知道，
曼·雷.

12:25.995 --> 12:29.832
Everyone loves
the new Krusty Kids Meal.
每个人都喜欢
新推出的 Krusty 儿童餐。

12:29.915 --> 12:33.919
And for a limited time,
get your free toy inside.
并且在有限的时间内，
把你的免费玩具放进去。

12:34.003 --> 12:37.298
How can I be evil
with flavors this good?
我怎么可以邪恶
味道这么好？

12:39.216 --> 12:41.677
Krabs calls that a commercial?
蟹老板称这是广告？

12:41.760 --> 12:43.762
Who'd fall for that schlock?
谁会爱上那个混蛋？

12:43.846 --> 12:45.806
Say...
说...

12:45.890 --> 12:48.142
Something  is  going
on over there.
有事发生
就在那儿。

12:53.731 --> 12:54.523
Ooh.
哦。

12:54.607 --> 12:57.526
The Krusty Krab welcomes...
蟹堡王欢迎...

12:57.610 --> 13:00.529
the Tarpon twins
海鲢双胞胎

13:00.613 --> 13:02.406
Here are your
Krabby Kids Meals.
这是你的
蟹蟹儿童餐。

13:05.284 --> 13:07.453
Never trust kids, Squidward.
永远不要相信孩子，章鱼哥。

13:07.536 --> 13:09.163
Never trust kids.
永远不要相信孩子。

13:09.246 --> 13:10.956
Gotta hand it to ya, boy.
必须把它交给你，孩子。

13:11.040 --> 13:14.210
Gettin' Mermaid Man and Barnacle
Boy to shill for me restaurant
获取美人鱼人和藤壶
男孩托我去餐厅

13:14.293 --> 13:16.170
was a stroke of genius.
真是天才之举。

13:16.253 --> 13:18.214
All in the line
of duty, Mr. Krabs.
一切都在一线
蟹老板，我的职责。

13:19.715 --> 13:21.175
Wasn't it great, Squidward?
不是很棒吗，章鱼哥？

13:21.258 --> 13:22.426
Great?
伟大的？

13:22.510 --> 13:24.470
Those little savages
tried to kill me.
那些小野人
试图杀了我。

13:24.553 --> 13:26.222
Yeah, but it's  so  worth it
是的，但是非常值得

13:26.305 --> 13:28.641
when you get to work in these.
当你开始从事这些工作时。

13:30.309 --> 13:31.268
Stupid kid.
傻孩子。

13:31.352 --> 13:32.311
Wait a minute.
等一下。

13:32.394 --> 13:33.312
What's this?
这是什么？

13:33.395 --> 13:34.355
Karen?
凯伦？

13:34.438 --> 13:36.232
My own wife.
我自己的妻子。

13:36.315 --> 13:38.150
Oh, how Krabs mocks me.
哦，蟹老板多么嘲笑我啊。

13:38.234 --> 13:39.652
Hi, honey.
嗨，亲爱的。

13:39.735 --> 13:40.903
What's that?
那是什么？

13:40.986 --> 13:43.989
A souvenir from
your boyfriend, Krabs?
纪念品来自
你的男朋友，蟹蟹？

13:44.073 --> 13:45.324
Oh, pipe down.
哦，管下来。

13:45.407 --> 13:48.244
I just went to get you
this Happy Hero Box.
我只是去接你
这个快乐英雄盒子。

13:48.327 --> 13:49.495
Well...
出色地...

13:49.578 --> 13:52.373
Thanks, babe,
you're too good to me.
谢谢，宝贝，
你对我太好了。

13:53.457 --> 13:55.459
A Mermaid Man action figure?
美人鱼人可动人偶？

13:55.543 --> 13:57.586
And a Barnacle Boy eraser?
还有藤壶男孩橡皮擦？

13:57.670 --> 14:00.089
Look at me,
I'm Barnacle Boy.
看着我，
我是藤壶男孩。

14:00.172 --> 14:01.966
Look at me,
I'm Mermaid Man.
看着我，
我是美人鱼男

14:03.092 --> 14:05.427
Krabs...
螃蟹...

14:14.353 --> 14:15.521
Sure...
当然...

14:15.604 --> 14:17.064
Why didn't I think
of this before?
为什么我没想到
以前有过这个吗？

14:17.147 --> 14:21.026
If Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
can build Krabs up
如果人鱼男和藤壶男孩
可以建造螃蟹

14:21.110 --> 14:23.529
they can tear him down, too.
他们也可以把他打倒。

14:29.952 --> 14:31.745
Plankton: Ding dong.
浮游生物：叮咚。

14:31.829 --> 14:33.706
Hello, boys.
你好，孩子们。

14:35.291 --> 14:36.125
Both: What, what-what?
两人：什么，什么——什么？

14:36.208 --> 14:37.751
I'm down here, fellas!
我在这儿，伙计们！

14:37.835 --> 14:39.128
Who are you?
你是谁？

14:39.211 --> 14:40.879
Oh, Professor Plankton.
噢，浮游生物教授。

14:40.963 --> 14:43.299
Door-to-door salesman.
上门推销员。

14:43.382 --> 14:44.758
My card.
我的卡。

14:44.842 --> 14:48.095
Professor Plankton's
personal products?
浮游生物教授的
个人产品？

14:48.178 --> 14:53.475
Say, you two look like a couple
of ladies' men, am I right?
话说你们两个像情侣啊
女装男装，我说得对吗？

14:54.393 --> 14:55.644
I knew it.
我就知道。

14:55.728 --> 14:58.647
Just look at that heroic chin.
只要看看那英勇的下巴就知道了。

14:58.731 --> 15:01.400
Those chiseled features.
那些轮廓分明的特征。

15:01.483 --> 15:02.526
That bra.
那个胸罩。

15:02.610 --> 15:04.194
But what's this?
但这是什么？

15:04.278 --> 15:05.321
Dandruff?
头皮？

15:05.404 --> 15:06.447
I've got dandruff?
我有头皮屑吗？

15:06.530 --> 15:09.116
You sure do.
你一定会的。

15:09.199 --> 15:10.034
See?
看？

15:10.117 --> 15:11.493
Oh, my.
哦，我的。

15:14.496 --> 15:15.414
Eww.
呃。

15:15.497 --> 15:17.207
A couple of studs like you
几个像你一样的螺柱

15:17.291 --> 15:19.001
can't go around like this.
不能这样到处走。

15:19.084 --> 15:21.879
Lucky for you,
Dr. Plankton's come prepared
你很幸运，
浮游生物博士有备而来

15:21.962 --> 15:24.340
with Plankton's
Dandruff Control Shampoo.
与浮游生物的
去屑洗发水。

15:24.423 --> 15:25.799
A little of this stuff
有点这个东西

15:25.883 --> 15:28.719
and the ladies'll be breakin'
down your door.
女士们会崩溃的
下你的门。

15:30.679 --> 15:32.681
Sign us up, Professor.
给我们报名吧，教授。

15:32.765 --> 15:35.017
wise decision,
gentlemen.
明智的决定，
先生们。

15:41.398 --> 15:42.733
Hey, what do we have here?
嘿，我们这里有什么？

15:42.816 --> 15:45.277
You fellas look a little peaked.
你们这些家伙看起来有点高了。

15:45.361 --> 15:47.905
Hmm, this shouldn't be.
嗯，这不应该是这样。

15:47.988 --> 15:49.907
I wonder.
我想知道。

15:49.990 --> 15:54.161
Say, this isn't
Professor Plankton's
Dandruff Control Shampoo.
说吧，这不是
浮游生物教授的
去屑洗发水。

15:54.244 --> 15:58.707
It's Professor Plankton's
Mind  Control Shampoo.
这是浮游生物教授的
精神控制洗发水。

15:59.583 --> 16:01.043
With conditioner.
带护发素。

16:01.126 --> 16:04.213
Time to prepare for your
next role, fellas
是时候为您的
下一个角色，伙计们

16:04.296 --> 16:07.174
as my zombies.
作为我的僵尸。

16:15.599 --> 16:17.518
Children:  :
We want Mermaid Man.
儿童: :
我们想要美人鱼男。

16:17.601 --> 16:19.478
We want Barnacle Boy.
我们想要藤壶男孩。

16:21.605 --> 16:23.399
Children: We want Mermaid Man.
孩子们：我们想要美人鱼人。

16:23.482 --> 16:25.359
We want Barnacle Boy.
我们想要藤壶男孩。

16:25.442 --> 16:27.361
We want Mermaid Man.
我们想要美人鱼男。

16:27.444 --> 16:29.154
Mr. Krabs: Uh... Hey, kids.
蟹老板：呃……嘿，孩子们。

16:29.238 --> 16:32.282
Uh, well, there's Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy,
in the ball room.
呃，好吧，还有美人鱼男
和藤壶男孩，
在舞厅里。

16:34.952 --> 16:36.412
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

16:36.495 --> 16:37.913
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

16:37.996 --> 16:40.332
Go get those AWOL do-gooders
you talked me into hiring
去找那些擅离职守的行善者吧
你说服我去招聘

16:40.416 --> 16:42.418
and bring their patoots
back here on the double.
并带来他们的爱国者
回到这里双。

16:42.501 --> 16:44.503
Aye, aye Mr. Krabs.
是的，是的，蟹老板。

16:44.586 --> 16:46.588
Back, you, back.
回来，你，回来。

16:53.429 --> 16:55.389
SpongeBob: Mermaid Man and
Barnacle Boy, please?
SpongeBob: Mermaid Man and
藤壶男孩，可以吗？

16:55.472 --> 16:56.432
And I'm kind of in a hurry.
我有点着急。

16:56.515 --> 16:57.641
Ahh!
啊！

17:04.606 --> 17:06.275
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

17:06.358 --> 17:07.693
You guys live in a dump.
你们住在垃圾场里。

17:07.776 --> 17:09.528
But we don't have
time for that right now.
但我们没有
现在是时候了。

17:09.611 --> 17:11.196
We gotta get you back
to the Krusty Krab
我们得让你回来
到蟹堡王

17:11.280 --> 17:12.531
for your special appearance.
为了你的特殊外表。

17:12.614 --> 17:13.866
I'll take you.
我带你去。

17:16.952 --> 17:21.206
Wow, I haven't seen you do
the spine-blaster since...
哇，我还没见过你这么做
脊椎爆破机自...

17:23.500 --> 17:26.378
Since episode 647...
从第647集开始...

17:28.464 --> 17:31.341
When you blasted
that guy's spine.
当你炸开的时候
那个人的脊椎。

17:32.760 --> 17:34.636
You still got it.
你还是明白了。

17:37.347 --> 17:40.142
Perch Perkins here,
live at the Krusty Krab.
鲈鱼珀金斯在这里，
住在蟹堡王。

17:40.225 --> 17:43.437
We're just moments away from
an important press conference
我们距离
一个重要的新闻发布会

17:43.520 --> 17:45.397
with Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy.
与美人鱼人
和藤壶男孩。

17:45.481 --> 17:47.733
I have with me here Eugene Krabs
我和尤金·克拉布斯在一起

17:47.816 --> 17:49.359
owner of the restaurant.
餐厅的老板。

17:49.443 --> 17:50.611
Any thoughts, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，有什么想法吗？

17:54.531 --> 17:55.824
: Oh, OK.
: 噢，好的。

17:55.908 --> 17:57.367
We'll come back to you later.
我们稍后再联系您。

17:57.451 --> 17:59.495
SpongeBob: Whoa...
海绵宝宝：哇…

17:59.578 --> 18:01.497
Ladies and gentlemen!
女士们，先生们！

18:01.580 --> 18:06.168
I present
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy.
我提出
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩。

18:16.553 --> 18:18.096
Oh, boy...
哦，男孩……

18:18.180 --> 18:20.849
everyone in Bikini Bottom
showed up.
比基尼泳裤中的每个人
出现了。

18:20.933 --> 18:24.394
This is gonna be  so  sweet.
这会很甜蜜。

18:26.355 --> 18:30.526
Mermaid Man, what is your
opinion of the Krabby Patty?
人鱼男，你是什么
对蟹黄派的看法？

18:30.609 --> 18:33.445
Ooh, this is too easy.
哦，这太容易了。

18:33.529 --> 18:35.989
Now just tell everyone that...
现在就告诉大家...

18:37.491 --> 18:40.994
I, Mermaid Man, think that
Krabby Patties are, uh...
我，美人鱼男，认为
蟹肉饼是，呃……

18:42.746 --> 18:43.539
Uh, what?
呃，什么？

18:43.622 --> 18:44.623
They're terrible.
他们太可怕了。

18:44.706 --> 18:46.458
You hate Krabby Patties.
你讨厌蟹肉饼。

18:46.542 --> 18:48.502
I'm late for "snappy pabbies?"
我迟到了？

18:48.585 --> 18:49.962
Barnacle Boy...
藤壶男孩...

18:50.045 --> 18:52.631
We're late for...
我们迟到了...

18:52.714 --> 18:55.843
Oh, for crying out loud.
哦，因为大声哭泣。

18:57.052 --> 19:00.430
Tell them you
hate Krabby Patties.
告诉他们你
讨厌蟹肉饼。

19:05.561 --> 19:06.603
What?
什么？

19:06.687 --> 19:07.479
SpongeBob:  :
Mermaid Man.
海绵宝宝：：
美人鱼男.

19:07.563 --> 19:08.814
What?
什么？

19:08.897 --> 19:10.983
I brought you something
to refresh your memory.
我给你带来了一些东西
来刷新你的记忆。

19:11.066 --> 19:14.319
Mermaid Man: Ooh,
a Krabby Patty.
人鱼男：哦，
蟹肉饼。

19:14.403 --> 19:16.029
Would you look at that.
你能看一下吗？

19:16.113 --> 19:17.239
Barnacle Boy.
藤壶男孩。

19:17.322 --> 19:18.574
It's a Krabby Patty.
这是蟹黄饼。

19:18.657 --> 19:20.450
Why these things are...
为什么这些东西是...

19:20.534 --> 19:22.160
evil...
邪恶的...

19:23.745 --> 19:25.372
Susie, no!
苏西，不！

19:25.455 --> 19:28.417
I hate these nasty things, puh.
我讨厌这些讨厌的东西，噗。

19:29.918 --> 19:31.837
And furthermore...
而且此外...

19:31.920 --> 19:33.672
Let it be known
that I, Mermaid Man
让大家知道
我，人鱼男

19:33.755 --> 19:36.592
prefer the delicious food
available at the Chum Bucket...
更喜欢美味的食物
可在 Chum Bucket 购买...

19:36.675 --> 19:39.553
Your new favorite restaurant.
您最喜欢的新餐厅。

19:39.636 --> 19:41.597
The Chum Bucket?
密友桶？

19:41.680 --> 19:42.931
Plankton must be behind this.
浮游生物一定是这件事的幕后黑手。

19:43.015 --> 19:43.724
Yes.
是的。

19:43.807 --> 19:47.060
Yes... It's working!
是的...它正在工作！

19:53.442 --> 19:55.527
Hold it right there.
把它握在那里。

19:55.611 --> 19:58.363
You forgot your
Krabby Patties.
你忘记了你的
蟹肉饼。

19:58.447 --> 20:00.198
Oh.
哦。

20:00.282 --> 20:01.617
Krabby Patties.
蟹肉饼。

20:01.700 --> 20:03.201
Krabby Patties.
蟹肉饼。

20:03.285 --> 20:04.161
Oh, no.
哦，不。

20:04.244 --> 20:06.622
Those infernal Krabby Patties.
那些地狱般的蟹肉饼。

20:06.705 --> 20:08.373
Their grease-fried deliciousness
他们的油煎美味

20:08.457 --> 20:12.336
could be enough to free
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy.
可能足以释放
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩。

20:23.472 --> 20:24.806
Not so fast.
没那么快。

20:24.890 --> 20:28.018
You're not dealing with
an ordinary fry cook.
你不是在处理
一个普通的炒菜厨师。

20:28.101 --> 20:30.354
It's time for you to meet...
你们见面的时间到了...

20:30.437 --> 20:32.481
fry boy.
油炸男孩。

20:32.564 --> 20:34.733
Defender of... uh-oh!
捍卫者……呃哦！

20:34.816 --> 20:36.485
Fry boy.
油炸男孩。

20:36.568 --> 20:38.820
Defender of the Krabby Patty.
克拉比帕蒂的防守者。

20:48.580 --> 20:49.498
Yah!
啊！

20:59.716 --> 21:00.759
Yes!
是的！

21:00.842 --> 21:02.469
You lose, Plankton.
你输了，浮游生物。

21:02.552 --> 21:06.473
Now watch as the Krabby Patties'
wholesome flavors
work their magic.
现在观看蟹黄肉饼的表演
有益健康的味道
发挥他们的魔力。

21:16.316 --> 21:17.818
I did it.
我做到了。

21:17.901 --> 21:18.819
I did it!
我做到了！

21:18.902 --> 21:21.530
Look at all these customers.
看看所有这些客户。

21:22.739 --> 21:25.033
In your face, Krabs.
在你的脸上，蟹蟹。

21:25.117 --> 21:25.951
Yes!
是的！

21:26.034 --> 21:27.828
So, uh... Where's the food?
那么，呃...食物在哪里？

21:30.330 --> 21:31.665
Food?
食物？

21:31.748 --> 21:32.791
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

21:32.874 --> 21:35.460
Never thought I'd get this far.
从来没想过我会走到这一步。

21:35.544 --> 21:37.337
It doesn't make sense.
这没有道理。

21:37.421 --> 21:40.632
They should have been cured
once the pureness of
the Krabby Patties
他们应该已经被治愈了
一旦纯洁
蟹肉饼

21:40.716 --> 21:42.217
entered their... That's it!
进入他们的...就是这样！

21:42.300 --> 21:44.177
Mermaid Man and
Barnacle Boy are elderly.
美人鱼男人和
藤壶男孩已经上了年纪了。

21:44.261 --> 21:48.682
Their poor aged tummies
must be having a hard time
digesting the food.
他们可怜的老肚子
一定过得很艰难
消化食物。

21:48.765 --> 21:50.892
I know just what to do.
我知道该怎么做。

22:02.821 --> 22:04.990
I'm back to my old self again.
我又变回原来的自己了。

22:05.073 --> 22:07.075
Thanks to you, SpongeBob.
谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

22:07.159 --> 22:09.161
And the delicious power
of Krabby Patties.
还有美味的力量
蟹肉饼。

22:09.244 --> 22:11.830
Say, I could use
a couple more of those
说，我可以用
还有几个

22:11.913 --> 22:14.750
and an order of Krabby fries.
和一份蟹黄薯条。

22:14.833 --> 22:16.001
And a decent latrine.
还有一个像样的厕所。

22:16.084 --> 22:18.712
Well, then, you guys
know where to go.
那么，你们
知道该去哪里。

22:18.795 --> 22:22.215
All: To the Krusty Krab, away.
全体：去蟹堡，走吧。

22:26.845 --> 22:28.847
Hey, everyone.
嘿，大家。

22:28.930 --> 22:31.058
I made Chummy Joes.
我做了巧克力乔。

我做了巧克力乔。